## Interface: 120100, 120105
## Title: Pet Stable Management
## Notes: Complementary pet stable panel for collection management (with advanced sorting, filtering, persistent pet data storage), and pet model browser panel for discovering next taming choices
## Author: Ginutty
## Version: 13.0.2
## IconTexture: 132253
## SavedVariables: PetStableManagementDB PSM_UserNotes
## OptionalDeps: Blizzard_StableUI

# Core modules (loaded first)
Core.lua

# Generated by the psm-data pipeline (never hand-edit).
Data/AbilitiesData.lua

# Asserts the table above matches what this addon expects (PSM_DataSchemaVersion).
